are","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"zbgsdPMmrNM_QiZXslbJXA","review_id":"sLsZOVZ3cWe4JBjkIINz0g","date":"2020-02-09T19:15:08","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.942304253578186,"text_excerpt":"What caught my eye at this place was the seafood queso on the menu so that was the one thing we were going to try first. It wasn't as phenomenal as I thought it was going to be, but it was different and nothing I've ever had before. Then, the charbroiled oysters were great. We both ordered cabernet and he brought us chardonnay. What's cool is he let us keep the chardonnays too. Our server was very friendly and cool."},{"business_id":"zbgsdPMmrNM_QiZXslbJXA","review_id":"cN-VUJDd9V_qLEFUsXuGeQ","date":"2019-10-13T02:25:15","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9163288474082947,"text_excerpt":"Food was really good. Highly recommend the crawfish bread, quite impressive. The only issues I had was that some of the rice in the creole combo didn't seem to be cooked. Otherwise, really enjoyed the food, and reasonably priced. Great place for the game. Quincy served us and made the dining experience even better. Thanks Quincy."},{"business_id":"zbgsdPMmrNM_QiZXslbJXA","review_id":"16pzfgSTddh58siJ5cvVZw","date":"2021-03-29T20:58:41","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9127408862113953,"text_excerpt":"Boy oh boy! Throughout our visit here - this place was probably the best restaurant we've eaten at! From the customer service, to the R&B music playing, to the amazing food- everything was great! My group and I decided to play, \"Card Roulette\" to see who would pay the bill. Our Waiter was so funny entertaining us with it! He and the other staff were so helpful, giving us advice as to where else to eat and things to experience. Highly recommended!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"zbgsdPMmrNM_QiZXslbJXA","photo_id":"aJBB54p6MKvNjZ1IDBwYlQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/aJBB54p6MKvNjZ1IDBwYlQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9192807674407959},{"business_id":"zbgsdPMmrNM_QiZXslbJXA","photo_id":"fAGBvm5xHkFvO9SKRdCgrQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/fAGBvm5xHkFvO9SKRdCgrQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8566333055496216},{"business_id":"zbgsdPMmrNM_QiZXslbJXA","photo_id":"pZssLEt9xVNu8Cs6S8y_6Q","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/pZssLEt9xVNu8Cs6S8y_6Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8154144287109375},{"business_id":"zbgsdPMmrNM_QiZXslbJXA","photo_id":"UvMrOCaMULcItvqVHhR-bQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/UvMrOCaMULcItvqVHhR-bQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8068544864654541}]},"notebook_case":null}
